    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Web App Idea Chatbot\r\n\r\nUse this chatbot to brainstorm ideas for your web app — what it could do, who it’s for, and how users will interact with it.\r\nYou can use it to get inspiration, think through possible user actions and outcomes, and clarify your app’s purpose.\r\n\r\n:::details [<i class=\"fa fa-briefcase\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> **Possible Stems**]\r\n* I want to make an interactive app about ___. What are some ways users could interact with it?\r\n* Give me a few ideas for outcomes or achievements that could make this app feel rewarding.\r\n* How could I make this app fun or useful for users?\r\n* Here’s my rough idea — can you help me expand or refine it?\r\n:::\r\n",
    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
    "submittable": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
